sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sweep as Sweep controller
    participant Field as Gauge field
    participant RNG as Random stream
    participant Action as Wilson action

    Sweep->>Field: Read U_mu(x) and neighboring links
    Field-->>Sweep: Current link and staples
    Sweep->>RNG: Draw group-valued perturbation R
    RNG-->>Sweep: R in the selected gauge group
    Sweep->>Sweep: Form proposal U'_mu(x) = R U_mu(x)
    Sweep->>Action: Evaluate affected plaquettes
    Action-->>Sweep: Delta S = S_local(U') - S_local(U)
    Sweep->>RNG: Draw u uniformly from [0, 1)
    RNG-->>Sweep: u
    alt log(u) is less than -Delta S
        Sweep->>Field: Commit U_mu(x) = U'_mu(x)
    else proposal rejected
        Sweep->>Field: Keep U_mu(x)
    end
    Sweep->>Sweep: Update acceptance counters
